# distribution — mean C2ST over 100 randomly sampled conditionals stays below 0.7 on Tree, HMM,
# Two Moons, SLCP at 1e5 sims (E02, Fig 4b). The single inductive_generalization claim in the
# M0 sample.
#
# Lowering notes (conventions: corpus-units/LOWERING.md):
#   * inductive_generalization family; conclusion generalizes_to(accurate_conditional_estimation,
#     arbitrary_conditionals). instance_validity is annotated met (E02 uses task-specific
#     HMC/slice+MH MCMC references, and every task clears the C2ST < 0.7 threshold at 1e5 sims).
#   * sample_representative is annotated UNMET-GAP and mandatory on BOTH the annotator's and
#     corpus-v1's standard: E02 samples 100 conditionals while the claim generalizes to all
#     arbitrary conditionals. The annotation's coverage_flag records that this sample-to-'all'
